                            <p>Hosting a game day party at home or tailgating with friends at the stadium this fall? Level up your menu with an air-fried chicken sandwich that’s bursting with woodfire flavor made on the Ninja Woodfire™ Outdoor Grill.</p>

<p>What makes the recipe unique? Chicken breast strips are breaded, then air-fried and wood-smoked at the same time, which results in a crispy bite and just a hint of smoke flavor. Build the sandwich in dagwood-style layers of veggies and chicken, each dressed with a drizzle of classic honey and mustard-based sauce. One bite of this beyond-basic party sandwich and guests will be back for more!</p>

